  <h3>What this site collects</h3>
  <p>When you use the contact form or the notary request form, I receive the details you enter: your name, email address, and, if you choose to give them, your phone number, message, and the address where a signing will take place.</p>

  <h3>How it's used</h3>
  <p>Only to reply to you and to arrange and complete the appointment you asked about. I don't sell or share your details for marketing.</p>

  <h3>Where it's stored</h3>
  <p>Form submissions are processed by the website host, Netlify, and delivered to my business email. Appointment scheduling may use Google Appointment Schedules or Square Appointments, which have their own privacy policies.</p>

  <h3>Questions or deletion requests</h3>
